 of \"this municipal library used to be an auroch burial ground and contains strange Usborne books about computers that didn't exist\" (<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scarfolk\">Scarfolk,</a> <a href=\"https://wyrdbritain.blogspot.com/\">Wyrd Britain</a>, <a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/windows95tips\">Windows 95 Tips</a>). &#8212; <a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/08/29/1119678.html\">Read the rest </a></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://boingboing.net/2026/08/29/1119678.html\">Belbury Poly turns its haunted synths to 80s fantasy</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://boingboing.net\">Boing Boing</a>.</p>",
